automatic, TERM=xterm-256color -> 256 colors
automatic, COLORTERM=truecolor -> true color
automatic, TERM=dumb -> no colors
output to a pipe -> no colors
true color: ESC[1;33;49mwarningESC[0m ESC[38;2;200;30;30;49mokkamaESC[0m
256 colors: ESC[1;33;49mwarningESC[0m ESC[38;5;160;49mokkamaESC[0m
8 colors: ESC[1;33;49mwarningESC[0m ESC[31;49mokkamaESC[0m
no colors: warning okkama
width of abc: 3
width of 日本: 4
width of é: 1
